    "Add restrict qualifiers on all pointer parameters in body_force and helper functions",
    "Hoist p[i] reads (xi,yi,zi) outside inner j-loop to reduce memory traffic",
    "Skip self-interaction (j==i continue) in inner loop",
    "Use #pragma omp parallel default(none) shared(...) around each iteration's force computation and position update to reuse threads across both loops",
    "Inside body_force, use #pragma omp for schedule(static) on outer i-loop for thread-level parallelism",
    "Add #pragma omp simd reduction(+:fx,fy,fz) aligned(px,py,pz:32) on inner force loop to enable vectorization with alignment hints",
    "Parallelize position update loop with #pragma omp for schedule(static)"
  ]
